sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor E as Viewer engineer
    participant SRC as viewer/src/*.tsx
    participant VITE as npm run build
    participant OUT as viewer/index.html
    participant TEST as tests/test_viewer_build.py
    participant MIG as migrate_bundle.py
    participant EXP as export_artifact.py

    E->>SRC: change one surface component
    E->>VITE: npm run build
    VITE->>OUT: write one self-contained file
    E->>TEST: run the suite
    TEST->>VITE: rebuild into a temporary directory
    TEST-->>E: fail when the committed file differs
    Note over TEST,OUT: The guard that stops anyone editing the output

    E->>MIG: run any mode against a bundle
    MIG->>OUT: read the plugin's built viewer
    MIG->>MIG: overwrite the bundle copy, unconditionally

    E->>EXP: /artifact:publish --pr 11
    EXP->>OUT: read verbatim
    EXP->>EXP: match named markers, inline STORY/DIFFS/ADRS/DIAGRAMS
    alt result over 16 MiB
        EXP->>EXP: retry at a lower tier, then drop audio
    end
    EXP-->>E: one publishable file
